@@ -34,3 +34,13 @@ exact source head in three independent jobs:
 
 The workflow has no path filter, no write permission, no persisted checkout
 credential and no mutable third-party Action reference.
+
+## Rust workspace feature qualification
+
+The workspace contains intentionally incompatible production, development, and
+device-conformance custody features. Qualification therefore runs the ordinary
+workspace with default features, then tests, lints, and documents every declared
+valid feature lane in isolation. It also proves that forbidden feature unions
+still fail with their expected custody-boundary diagnostics. A Python regression
+compares the matrix against every non-default feature declared by workspace
+packages so a newly added feature cannot silently escape qualification.
